  "description": "Our Reid Let’s range is designed to be the most accessible route to a quality eBike for all. The Let’s GO is at the forefront of this.\nDesigned with ease of use at the top of the brief, the Let’s GO simply allows you to GO! The low step frame makes getting on a breeze and the upright riding position means you feel right at home as soon as you sit down. On the move you have a powerful 250w motor with five levels of assist making cycling as effortless as you desire, and with a 375wh battery you’ll be surprised at how far you can GO.\nEquipped with sturdy but fast 27.5” tyres, the ride will be cloud like yet grippy. Stopping is taken care of by powerful Alloy V brakes, and the 7 speed gearing is provided by ultra reliable and user friendly Shimano. If you ever wanted a bike that made cycling easy, the Let’s GO is it. GO for it, what are you waiting for!\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
